{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the base-image build/promote/extend matrices (ADR 0019).",
    "Consumed by .github/workflows/{build,promote,extend}-base-image.yml via jq; the",
    "list previously lived inline in all three, so a patch bump had to be applied three",
    "times and a miss was silent.",
    "ORDER IS SIGNIFICANT: promote walks these in order and the auto-tag dance depends",
    "on it. Append new configs; do not reorder to tidy.",
    "The cuda-X.Y.Z-auto tag name is DERIVED from tag_template at promote time, never",
    "stored here - a second source of truth for a customer-facing tag name is how one",
    "silently stops being updated."
  ],
  "python_versions": [
    "3.10",
    "3.11",
    "3.12",
    "3.13",
    "3.14"
  ],
  "mini_python_versions": [
